      "id": 1,
      "text": "From the Heian period, Tada-in became a sacred site for the Seiwa Genji clan after Minamoto no Mitsunaka retired there.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
